### Send Command to Specific Router
GRPC localhost:50051/api.v1.RouterService/SendCommand

{
  "router_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "command_type": "REBOOT",
  "payload": "{\"reason\": \"scheduled maintenance\", \"delay_seconds\": 30}"
}

### Poll Outstanding Commands for a Router
GRPC localhost:50051/api.v1.RouterService/PollOutstandingCommands

{
  "router_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
}

### Acknowledge Command Completion
GRPC localhost:50051/api.v1.RouterService/AcknowledgeCommand

{
  "router_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "command_id": "dec31cb2-0959-41d7-8194-bfe59ba4acb1"
}